      "en": "There all the flocks were gathered. They rolled the stone from the well’s mouth, and watered the sheep, and put the stone back on the well’s mouth in its place.",
      "ko": "모든 떼가 모이면 그들이 우물 아구에서 돌을 옮기고 양에게 물을 먹이고는 여전히 우물 아구 그 자리에 돌을 덮더라",
      "source_text_hash": "9262c1f8bdb636f156a0f1c3c880f39706b7023e4c45907b63de798d55fa7607",
      "translation_text_hash": "23ce75e6631f8e5486a2dff825e96168e7e18a9155c58271f625cc4993433b36",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
