      "en": "Jacob said to them, “My relatives, where are you from?” They said, “We are from Haran.”",
      "ko": "야곱이 그들에게 이르되 나의 형제여 어디로서뇨 그들이 가로되 하란에서로라",
      "source_text_hash": "a2fb7059a64ef053fef2ead14acd68a2b3dbd98c37dbff1e84d8e3b35a5054fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "8a713434b8ae343601a33b91373ed235a7d4ca3f83dca97e4a3d015a7ca060e4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
