      "en": "He said, “Behold, it is still the middle of the day, not time to gather the livestock together. Water the sheep, and go and feed them.”",
      "ko": "야곱이 가로되 해가 아직 높은즉 짐승 모일 때가 아니니 양에게 물을 먹이고 가서 뜯기라",
      "source_text_hash": "1c8bcb251f6f4e32dc9c18187bf2681989b9ecfecbc2c3ad9158ae89662bf8ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "b9b83f98fc78fbe270342ce13b77ad8475b5fc1ebb32b88cb9ce51211f567c6f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
