      "en": "Jacob kissed Rachel, and lifted up his voice, and wept.",
      "ko": "그가 라헬에게 입맞추고 소리내어 울며",
      "source_text_hash": "f089859b3b1e5136fb757c3fa595ebbd1898fe9aeeb9d289c876303dafc26c50",
      "translation_text_hash": "a51379eeed3732fb2fcc1949fbe10cff8c63edcca079d027a7fc1c321649904e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
